{"title": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Pure substances, mixtures, solutions</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纯净物、混合物与溶液</span>", "slides": [{"id": "c3-mixtures:title", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🧩 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Classifying Matter</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质的分类</span></div><h2 class=\"s-title\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Pure substances, mixtures, solutions</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纯净物、混合物与溶液</span></h2><p class=\"s-hook\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Salt water, trail mix, copper, sugar, air — every one lands in exactly one box of the classification tree. Learn the two questions that walk you down the tree and this whole section is marks.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">盐水、什锦坚果、铜、糖、空气——每一样都正好落在分类树的一个格子里。学会沿着树往下走的两个问题，这一整节就是送分。</span></span></p><div class=\"s-diff\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Difficulty</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难度</span> <b>●●○</b></div><div class=\"s-meta\">⏱ 35 min · ★ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">essential</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必会</span></div>"}, {"id": "c3-mixtures:keys", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🔑 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Must know</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必须记住</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Pure substances, mixtures, solutions</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纯净物、混合物与溶液</span></div><ol class=\"s-list\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Homogeneous = 1 phase; heterogeneous = more than 1 phase = mechanical mixture.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">均匀＝1 个相；不均匀＝不止 1 个相＝机械混合物。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Homogeneous splits: pure substance (constant composition) vs solution (variable composition).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">均匀物质再分：纯净物（组成固定）与溶液（组成可变）。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Pure splits: element (1 type of atom) vs compound (more than 1). Solute dissolves in solvent.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纯净物再分：元素（1 种原子）与化合物（不止 1 种）。溶质溶于溶剂。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 210\" class=\"fig wide\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"element, compound, mixture particles\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"22\" width=\"138\" height=\"128\" rx=\"14\" class=\"cbox\"/><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"50\" r=\"9\" class=\"ag\"/><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"50\" r=\"9\" class=\"ag\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"50\" r=\"9\" class=\"ag\"/><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"84\" r=\"9\" class=\"ag\"/><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"84\" r=\"9\" class=\"ag\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"84\" r=\"9\" class=\"ag\"/><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"118\" r=\"9\" class=\"ag\"/><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"118\" r=\"9\" class=\"ag\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"118\" r=\"9\" class=\"ag\"/><text x=\"79\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct\" style=\"font-size:11px\">Element (atoms)</text><text x=\"79\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">元素：原子</text><rect x=\"158\" y=\"22\" width=\"138\" height=\"128\" rx=\"14\" class=\"cbox\"/><circle cx=\"182\" cy=\"52\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"194\" cy=\"52\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"218\" cy=\"52\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"52\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"254\" cy=\"52\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"266\" cy=\"52\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"182\" cy=\"88\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"194\" cy=\"88\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"218\" cy=\"88\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"88\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"254\" cy=\"88\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"266\" cy=\"88\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><text x=\"227\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct\" style=\"font-size:11px\">Element (molecules)</text><text x=\"227\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">元素：分子 O₂</text><rect x=\"306\" y=\"22\" width=\"138\" height=\"128\" rx=\"14\" class=\"cbox\"/><circle cx=\"336\" cy=\"48\" r=\"10\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"325\" cy=\"56\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"347\" cy=\"56\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"374\" cy=\"48\" r=\"10\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"363\" cy=\"56\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"385\" cy=\"56\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"412\" cy=\"48\" r=\"10\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"401\" cy=\"56\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"423\" cy=\"56\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"336\" cy=\"90\" r=\"10\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"325\" cy=\"98\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"347\" cy=\"98\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"374\" cy=\"90\" r=\"10\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"363\" cy=\"98\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"385\" cy=\"98\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"412\" cy=\"90\" r=\"10\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"401\" cy=\"98\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"423\" cy=\"98\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><text x=\"375\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct\" style=\"font-size:11px\">Compound</text><text x=\"375\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">化合物 H₂O</text><rect x=\"454\" y=\"22\" width=\"138\" height=\"128\" rx=\"14\" class=\"cbox\"/><circle cx=\"478\" cy=\"52\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"490\" cy=\"52\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"522\" cy=\"48\" r=\"10\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"511\" cy=\"56\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"533\" cy=\"56\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"554\" cy=\"52\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"566\" cy=\"52\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"484\" cy=\"90\" r=\"10\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"473\" cy=\"98\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"495\" cy=\"98\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"516\" cy=\"94\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"528\" cy=\"94\" r=\"9\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"560\" cy=\"90\" r=\"10\" class=\"ao\"/><circle cx=\"549\" cy=\"98\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><circle cx=\"571\" cy=\"98\" r=\"6\" class=\"ah\"/><text x=\"523\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct\" style=\"font-size:11px\">Mixture</text><text x=\"523\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">混合物 O₂ + H₂O</text></svg></div>"}, {"id": "c3-mixtures:fig0", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🖼️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Picture it</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看图理解</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Pure substances, mixtures, solutions</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纯净物、混合物与溶液</span></div><div class=\"s-fig\"><div class=\"mtree\"><ul><li><span class=\"tn d0\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">ALL SUBSTANCES</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">所有物质</span></span></span><ul><li><span class=\"tn d1\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">HOMOGENEOUS SUBSTANCES</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">均匀物质</span></span><span class=\"tn-note\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">only one phase</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">只有一个相</span></span></span></span><ul><li><span class=\"tn d2\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">PURE SUBSTANCES</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纯净物</span></span><span class=\"tn-note\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">constant composition</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">组成固定</span></span></span></span><ul><li><span class=\"tn d3\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">ELEMENT</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">元素（单质）</span></span><span class=\"tn-note\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">1 type of atom present</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">只有 1 种原子</span></span></span></span></li><li><span class=\"tn d3\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">COMPOUND</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">化合物</span></span><span class=\"tn-note\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">more than 1 type of atom present</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不止 1 种原子</span></span></span></span></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"tn d2\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">HOMOGENEOUS MIXTURES</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">均匀混合物</span></span><span class=\"tn-note\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">variable composition</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">组成可变</span></span></span></span><ul><li><span class=\"tn d3\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">SOLUTION</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">溶液</span></span></span></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"tn d1\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">HETEROGENEOUS SUBSTANCES</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不均匀物质</span></span><span class=\"tn-note\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">more than one phase</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不止一个相</span></span></span></span><ul><li><span class=\"tn d2\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">MECHANICAL MIXTURES</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">机械混合物</span></span><span class=\"tn-note\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">variable composition</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">组成可变</span></span></span></span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></div></div>"}, {"id": "c3-mixtures:hard", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker hard\">🧗 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The hard part</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难点</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Pure substances, mixtures, solutions</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纯净物、混合物与溶液</span></div><h3 class=\"s-h\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Pure substance vs solution</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纯净物与溶液</span></span></h3><p class=\"s-why\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Both are one phase and look identical.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">两者都是一个相，看起来一模一样。</span></span></p><ol class=\"s-steps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Does it have one fixed formula? → pure.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有单一固定化学式吗？→纯净物。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Can the amounts change (more or less salty/sweet)? → solution.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">比例能变吗（更咸／更甜）？→溶液。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Evidence: evaporating a solution leaves the solute behind.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">证据：溶液蒸干后会留下溶质。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-try\"><b><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Try</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">试一试</span></b> <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Pure substance or solution: (a) apple juice (b) <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (pure hydrogen peroxide)</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纯净物还是溶液：(a) 苹果汁 (b) <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（纯过氧化氢）</span></div><details><summary><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Answer</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">答案</span></summary><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">(a) solution (b) pure substance (compound)</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">(a) 溶液 (b) 纯净物（化合物）</span></div></details></div>"}, {"id": "c3-mixtures:traps", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker trap\">⚠️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Traps &amp; tip</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">陷阱与提示</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Pure substances, mixtures, solutions</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纯净物、混合物与溶液</span></div><ul class=\"s-list traps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Clear liquid = pure → could be a solution (salt water).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">澄清液体＝纯净物 → 也可能是溶液（盐水）。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Compound = mixture (has 2 elements) → compound is pure (fixed formula).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">化合物＝混合物（含两种元素）→ 化合物是纯净物（化学式固定）。</span></div></li></ul><div class=\"s-tnote\">🟡 <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Your class notes list soil as a homogeneous mixture. Most textbooks call soil heterogeneous (a mechanical mixture), because you can usually see bits of sand, clay and plant matter. On this test, if soil is asked, use the class answer: homogeneous mixture.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">课堂讲义把土壤列为均匀混合物。多数教材把土壤归为不均匀混合物（机械混合物），因为通常能看到沙粒、黏土和植物残渣。考试如果问到土壤，按讲义答：均匀混合物。</span></div></div><div class=\"s-tip\">🎯 <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Three questions in order: phases? fixed composition? types of atom?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">按顺序三问：几个相？组成固定？几种原子？</span></div></div>"}], "cards": [{"id": "c3-mixtures.c0", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Homogeneous vs heterogeneous?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">均匀与不均匀？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Homogeneous: one phase, looks the same. Heterogeneous: more than one phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">均匀：一个相，处处相同。不均匀：不止一个相。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c3-mixtures.c1", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Pure substance vs homogeneous mixture?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纯净物与均匀混合物？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Pure: constant composition, one substance. Homogeneous mixture: variable composition, 2+ substances.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纯净物：组成固定、一种物质。均匀混合物：组成可变、2 种以上物质。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c3-mixtures.c2", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Another name for a homogeneous mixture? For a heterogeneous mixture?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">均匀混合物的另一个名称？不均匀混合物呢？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Solution. Mechanical mixture.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">溶液。机械混合物。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c3-mixtures.c3", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Solute vs solvent in salt water?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">盐水中的溶质和溶剂？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Solute: salt (gets dissolved). Solvent: water (does the dissolving).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">溶质：盐（被溶解）。溶剂：水（起溶解作用）。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c3-mixtures.c4", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Class answer: soil is…?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">讲义答案：土壤是……？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A homogeneous mixture (class version; many textbooks say heterogeneous).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">均匀混合物（讲义说法；很多教材说不均匀）。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c3-mixtures.c5", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Element vs compound on the tree?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">分类树上元素与化合物？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Both pure substances. Element: 1 type of atom. Compound: more than 1 type.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">都是纯净物。元素：1 种原子。化合物：不止 1 种原子。</span></div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "c3-mixtures.p1", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A homogeneous mixture is also called a ___.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">均匀混合物又叫作 ___。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Salt water is an example.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">盐水就是一个例子。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Solution</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">溶液</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Homogeneous mixture = solution.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">均匀混合物＝溶液。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c3-mixtures.p2", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">In sugar water, which substance is the solute?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">糖水中，哪种物质是溶质？</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Solute gets dissolved; solvent does the dissolving.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">溶质被溶解；溶剂起溶解作用。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Sugar</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">糖</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Sugar dissolves into the water → sugar is the solute, water is the solvent.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">糖溶进水里→糖是溶质，水是溶剂。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c3-mixtures.p3", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Classify distilled water (<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span></span></span></span></span>): element, compound, solution or mechanical mixture?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">给蒸馏水（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span></span></span></span></span>）分类：元素、化合物、溶液还是机械混合物？</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Is there one fixed formula? How many types of atom?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有单一固定化学式吗？几种原子？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Compound (pure substance)</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">化合物（纯净物）</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Distilled water is only <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span></span></span></span></span> → pure substance; H and O → compound.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">蒸馏水只含 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span></span></span></span></span>→纯净物；含 H 和 O→化合物。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c3-mixtures.p4", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Classify muddy pond water in which you can see bits of dirt floating.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">给能看到泥土颗粒漂浮的浑浊池塘水分类。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Does it look the same everywhere?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">处处看起来一样吗？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Mechanical (heterogeneous) mixture</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">机械混合物（不均匀混合物）</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">You can see dirt and water → more than one phase → mechanical mixture.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">能看见泥和水→不止一个相→机械混合物。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c3-mixtures.p5", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Which one is a solution?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">哪一个是溶液？</span></div>", "opts": ["<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Copper wire</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">铜线</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Brass (copper and zinc evenly melted together)</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">黄铜（铜和锌均匀熔合）</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A salad</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">沙拉</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Table salt, NaCl</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">食盐 NaCl</span></span>"], "a": 1, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Solutions can be solid too — like air is a gas solution.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">溶液也可以是固体——就像空气是气体溶液。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Brass</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">黄铜</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Copper: element. NaCl: compound. Salad: mechanical mixture.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">铜：元素。NaCl：化合物。沙拉：机械混合物。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c3-mixtures.p6", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Classify each and give the path down the tree: (a) seawater (b) oxygen gas <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (c) concrete with visible stones (d) baking soda <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">NaHCO</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">给每样分类并写出沿树往下的路径：(a) 海水 (b) 氧气 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (c) 能看见石子的混凝土 (d) 小苏打 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">NaHCO</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Which ones have a single formula?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">哪些有单一化学式？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">(a) homogeneous → mixture → solution (b) homogeneous → pure → element (c) heterogeneous → mechanical mixture (d) homogeneous → pure → compound</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">(a) 均匀→混合物→溶液 (b) 均匀→纯净物→元素 (c) 不均匀→机械混合物 (d) 均匀→纯净物→化合物</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">(a) Salts dissolved in water, uniform, saltiness varies → solution.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">(a) 盐类溶于水、均匀、咸度可变→溶液。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c3-mixtures.p7", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">According to your class notes, soil is classified as:</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">按课堂讲义，土壤属于：</span></div>", "opts": ["<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">An element</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">元素</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A compound</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">化合物</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A homogeneous mixture</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">均匀混合物</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A pure substance</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纯净物</span></span>"], "a": 2, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It is in the class list next to air and salt water.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">讲义中它和空气、盐水列在一起。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A homogeneous mixture (class version)</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">均匀混合物（讲义说法）</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Soil has many substances in varying amounts → a mixture, not pure.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">土壤含多种比例不定的物质→混合物，不是纯净物。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c3-mixtures.p8", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A student is given an unknown clear, colourless liquid. When a sample is heated until all the liquid is gone, a white solid is left in the dish. Is the liquid a pure substance or a solution? Explain using the classification tree.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">学生拿到一种未知的澄清无色液体。取样加热到液体全部蒸干后，碟子里留下白色固体。这种液体是纯净物还是溶液？用分类树说明。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Where did the white solid come from?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">白色固体从哪里来？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A solution. It is one phase (clear, uniform), so it is homogeneous — but heating left a white solid, so it contained at least two substances: a dissolved solid (solute) in a liquid (solvent). Two substances with variable amounts = homogeneous mixture = solution.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">溶液。它是一个相（澄清均匀），所以是均匀物质——但加热后留下白色固体，说明它至少含两种物质：溶解的固体（溶质）和液体（溶剂）。两种物质、比例可变＝均匀混合物＝溶液。</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Clear and uniform → one phase → homogeneous (pure substance OR solution).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">澄清均匀→一个相→均匀物质（纯净物或溶液）。</span></div>", "whys": null}], "v": 1, "key": "topic-c3-mixtures"}